<title>ISRAEL: Israel's IDB Development Q2 net up.</title>
<headline>Israel's IDB Development Q2 net up.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>IDB Development Corp, a subsidiary of IDB Holding Corp.</p>
<p>			 (In thousands of shekels)</p>
<p>			 Q2 96	 Q2 95	6-MTH 96    6-MTH 95</p>
<p>Revenue		393,298     398,067    818,096     719,019</p>
<p>Pretax profit	105,321	98,406    229,455     175,679</p>
<p>Net profit	    52,535	36,358    114,896	63,897</p>
<p>($1=3.20 shekels on June 30)</p>
<p>- Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211</p>
</text>
